{
  "title": "Frodhes",
  "children": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "lines": [
        "Physical models of",
        "an electric piano",
        "(four types), a",
        "vibraphone and a",
        "marimba. No samples.",
        "TYPE on the first",
        "page picks the",
        "instrument; its",
        "VOICE pages follow",
        "it.",
        "",
        "SUS is the sustain",
        "pedal, on or off: ON",
        "holds the notes, OFF",
        "lets them go. A",
        "pedal on CC 64 works",
        "too.",
        "",
        "PAGES opens Frodhes'",
        "own screen: touch",
        "its knob and click",
        "the jog wheel. Eight",
        "cards a page, a",
        "touched knob shown",
        "large. The jog wheel",
        "turns the pages; a",
        "click lists them.",
        "Capture turns SUS on",
        "or off there. FX",
        "turns all effects",
        "off or on.",
        "",
        "Frodhes plays in one",
        "slot at a time."
      ]
    },
